<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1>Cleaning, done properly.</h1>
    <p><%= site.name %> was built on a simple idea: cleaning should be reliable, thorough, and hassle-free.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid-2 align-center">
    <div class="about-media" role="img" aria-label="Cleaning team"></div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
      <h2>Built on trust and attention to detail</h2>
      <p>
        For over 10 years, <%= site.name %> has provided professional cleaning across London and
        Essex — with around 4,500 properties cleaned and more than 1,580 satisfied clients along
        the way. We never use subcontractors: cleaning is our core specialty, so every job is done
        by our own trained, vetted and insured staff.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today we work with homeowners, landlords, letting agents, schools, nurseries and businesses
        across the area, offering everything from a quick weekly tidy to a full end-of-tenancy deep
        clean — backed by a 100% clean guarantee and the latest tools and products in the industry.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section alt-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Values</span>
      <h2>What guides how we work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="service-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>Reliability</h3>
        <p>We show up on time, every time, and communicate clearly if anything ever changes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="service-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Attention to Detail</h3>
        <p>We don't cut corners — every clean follows a checklist so nothing gets missed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="service-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Trust</h3>
        <p>Background-checked, insured cleaners you can feel comfortable letting into your home or office.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta-band">
  <div class="container cta-band-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Want to work with us?</h2>
      <p>Get a free quote and see the difference a properly done clean makes.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>
